{"data": [{"author_id": "2015587340597792768", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:09:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423972644163683"], "id": "2117423972644163683", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@xiaobeistudio @dotey manus这几样无疑是顶尖的！", "url": "https://x.com/DejaVuGPT/status/2117423972644163683"}, {"author_id": "2953739684", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:09:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423877806772539"], "id": "2117423877806772539", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 同意，提示词和流程能被看穿，但用户信任看不穿。\n\n对普通用户来说也一样：选工具先看谁能长期更新、出了问题有人管，比看功能表更重要。", "url": "https://x.com/AzrianoY1/status/2117423877806772539"}, {"author_id": "137223527", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:56:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420549374886086"], "id": "2117420549374886086", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 能看穿和能复制是两回事：提示词、skills 抄得走，但真实用户的反馈闭环、迭代速度和品牌信任抄不走。克隆版卡在从 demo 到可用产品的最后一公里——多步任务的成功率、工具链的稳定性，这些才是用户留下的理由。", "url": "https://x.com/neo_cn/status/2117420549374886086"}, {"author_id": "2108598498849656832", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:49:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117418834046972096"], "id": "2117418834046972096", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 同感，现在 harness 和提示词基本藏不住了，真正的壁垒变成分发、品牌和迭代速度。克隆一个客户端容易，克隆用户习惯难。", "url": "https://x.com/Linc3lls/status/2117418834046972096"}, {"author_id": "2117072122145284096", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:43:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117417256523383288"], "id": "2117417256523383288", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 说的很对，技术是能被看穿，但护城河在数据、多步任务的成功率和工具接得稳不稳", "url": "https://x.com/xiaobeistudio/status/2117417256523383288"}, {"author_id": "392425784", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:38:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117416129098559847"], "id": "2117416129098559847", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 客户端半透明到提示词都能拆，护城河不在技术克隆，而在用户为什么留下。", "url": "https://x.com/XXKING/status/2117416129098559847"}, {"author_id": "1125088970969210880", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:35:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117415406642319658"], "id": "2117415406642319658", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 产品一步慢，步步慢 核心还是快速贴近用户", "url": "https://x.com/NextNote_App/status/2117415406642319658"}, {"author_id": "147154620", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:27:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117413249004318852"], "id": "2117413249004318852", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 一个产品的成功，是多方面因素的叠加品牌，市场，技术，还有就是时机，破解能结局的事从 0 到 demo，解决不了后面的过程，通过“借鉴”来做产品，最大的成本选择成本，当什么都借鉴时，慢慢的就变成的四不像的功能堆砌", "url": "https://x.com/yongfeng_liu/status/2117413249004318852"}, {"author_id": "840757822681899009", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:22:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117412175111463054"], "id": "2117412175111463054", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 同意。软件越来越透明，护城河会转到 AI 抄不走的地方：供应链、品牌和用户信任。做了 20 年消费品，我的体会是产品能复制，交付能力和信任很难复制。", "url": "https://x.com/haifeng1974/status/2117412175111463054"}, {"author_id": "1707322478", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117408210206462166"], "id": "2117408210206462166", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 代码可以复制，用户的信任复制不了。AI产品最终拼的是谁能持续解决用户的问题", "url": "https://x.com/whb0821/status/2117408210206462166"}, {"author_id": "2008900298085900288", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:52:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117404429347586481"], "id": "2117404429347586481", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 很实在的判断。逆向工程能扒出今天的参数和提示词，但扒不出团队试错时毙掉的那几十个废案。抄代码最多复刻一个静态快照，等别人根据真实用户反馈改下一版时，纯靠模仿的人连改哪行都不知道。", "url": "https://x.com/Neo19990331/status/2117404429347586481"}, {"author_id": "2043862808882708480", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:36:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117400581199519958"], "id": "2117400581199519958", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 代码越来越容易复制，用户信任和分发反而越来越难复制。克隆功能不等于克隆产品。", "url": "https://x.com/staroaeg/status/2117400581199519958"}, {"author_id": "963314524798337024", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:36:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117400492544340052"], "id": "2117400492544340052", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@parkmanpcl @dotey 权限交出去我也会慌", "url": "https://x.com/tmhyt1/status/2117400492544340052"}, {"author_id": "4773557952", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:30:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117398911728091388"], "id": "2117398911728091388", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 主要是 Agent 这种要把环境和操作权限交出去的产品，信任成本太高了。不知名团队克隆一个真不敢随便用，代码抄得走，这种背书根本抄不来。", "url": "https://x.com/parkmanpcl/status/2117398911728091388"}, {"author_id": "1867176094987935744", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:01:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376586358124727"], "id": "2117376586358124727", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 能看懂怎么做，和让用户愿意换过去，还是两回事。", "url": "https://x.com/An_yhl/status/2117376586358124727"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:00:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361278872420753"], "id": "2117361278872420753", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 真绝，自定义API等于把后端逻辑送上门\n代码层再防也就是多撑两天，扒完照样能抄", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117361278872420753"}, {"author_id": "202320764", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:58:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117360791120908522"], "id": "2117360791120908522", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 93, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 意义不大", "url": "https://x.com/teoleung/status/2117360791120908522"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:45:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117357339841814832"], "id": "2117357339841814832", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 真绝。客户端半透明到提示词都能扒，护城河只剩品牌和习惯了。技术壁垒这层基本没了。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117357339841814832"}, {"author_id": "1516075159169363969", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:51:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117343931168104497"], "id": "2117343931168104497", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 196, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 品牌信任这点太真实了，克隆版连装都不敢装", "url": "https://x.com/Easloai/status/2117343931168104497"}, {"author_id": "751208885533351936", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:48:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117343208598556841"], "id": "2117343208598556841", "lang": "ja", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey その通りだと思います。プロンプトやharnessは解析できても、失敗ケースの蓄積やトラブル時の対応力まではコピーできません。結局ユーザーが選ぶのは機能一覧ではなく「任せて大丈夫」という安心感ですよね。皆さんは乗り換えを決める時、何を一番重視しますか？", "url": "https://x.com/uV30FW65XOo0hOC/status/2117343208598556841"}, {"author_id": "1164980832446111744", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:33:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117339321556492566"], "id": "2117339321556492566", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 功能可以照着做，用户的信任却没法一起复制过来。", "url": "https://x.com/freedomledgerhq/status/2117339321556492566"}, {"author_id": "1475680453549981702", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117331107742093320"], "id": "2117331107742093320", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 能看懂它怎么跑的人，多半懒得自己搭一套；看不懂的，打开页面先找自己听过的名字。这落差比护城河还难补。", "url": "https://x.com/SteadyOperator/status/2117331107742093320"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:39:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117325747672981554"], "id": "2117325747672981554", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 服了，客户端半透明说明护城河早不在壳子里了。分发和习惯才值钱，克隆壳没人买账", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117325747672981554"}, {"author_id": "1648903034691530752", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:33:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117324113387872514"], "id": "2117324113387872514", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 护城河漏水了", "url": "https://x.com/xiaoshan0413/status/2117324113387872514"}, {"author_id": "1866649697672384512", "conversation_id": "2117306470727336321", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:32:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117323929597743117"], "id": "2117323929597743117", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 295, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey AI native 应用，ROI 很难&gt;1 ，最好拉到投资再说，而且现在也拉不到。", "url": "https://x.com/Enzorouxx/status/2117323929597743117"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2015587340597792768", "name": "逮虾户", "username": "DejaVuGPT"}, {"id": "2953739684", "name": "0xAzr", "username": "AzrianoY1"}, {"id": "137223527", "name": "neo.w", "username": "neo_cn"}, {"id": "2108598498849656832", "name": "Linc", "username": "Linc3lls"}, {"id": "2117072122145284096", "name": "汤圆小贝", "username": "xiaobeistudio"}, {"id": "392425784", "name": "邪修King🚀", "username": "XXKING"}, {"id": "1125088970969210880", "name": "陈 Sir | AI All", "username": "NextNote_App"}, {"id": "147154620", "name": "yongfeng", "username": "yongfeng_liu"}, {"id": "840757822681899009", "name": "Haifeng💯", "username": "haifeng1974"}, {"id": "1707322478", "name": "景哥｜AI增长与落地", "username": "whb0821"}, {"id": "2008900298085900288", "name": "Neo", "username": "Neo19990331"}, {"id": "2043862808882708480", "name": "生晓bai", "username": "staroaeg"}, {"id": "963314524798337024", "name": "小蓝(互关交友版）", "username": "tmhyt1"}, {"id": "4773557952", "name": "无事乱翻书", "username": "parkmanpcl"}, {"id": "1867176094987935744", "name": "晚晚", "username": "An_yhl"}, {"id": "1717809218731065344", "name": "AI速递 | 李博", "username": "libo_ai"}, {"id": "202320764", "name": "Teo", "username": "teoleung"}, {"id": "1516075159169363969", "name": "Easlo 🚀｜一人公司 × AI", "username": "Easloai"}, {"id": "751208885533351936", "name": "あすか", "username": "uV30FW65XOo0hOC"}, {"id": "1164980832446111744", "name": "John｜The Freedom Ledger", "username": "freedomledgerhq"}, {"id": "1475680453549981702", "name": "Steady Operator", "username": "SteadyOperator"}, {"id": "1648903034691530752", "name": "Wen | 阿栗AI", "username": "xiaoshan0413"}, {"id": "1866649697672384512", "name": "Enzo 🐬", "username": "Enzorouxx"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117423972644163683", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyibgjo5j57htrvn0dc5zwhq3r1", "oldest_id": "2117323929597743117", "result_count": 25}}